		<div class="row mb-5 justify-content-between">
			<div class="col-lg-6 text-black-100 order-lg-2">
				<p>
					"Wednesday" is a TV series for Netflix, written by Alfred Gough and Miles Millar, and directed by Tim Burton.
				</p>
				<p>
					Kerry Shale has announced on 1st August 2024 that "Wednesday" Season 2 is currently filmed. If he announces it in person, he will surely be in it then as well.
					Deadline from February 2024 writes that the production will be in a new location, in Ireland. Regarding to them, Netflix had revealed that the production of Season 2 was delayed by the writers and actors strikes.
					But maybe we are in luck and we still can see Season 2 before 2025. Let us wait and see.<br />
					Written by Alfred Gough and Miles Millar. Directed by Tim Burton. Produced by Carmen Pepelea.
				</p>
				<p>
					More information:<br />
					- <a href="https://deadline.com/2024/02/stranger-things-ginny-amp-georgia-wednesday-virgin-river-delayed-2025-netflix-1235810685/" target="_blank">Deadline about "Wednesday"</a>
				</p>
				<p>
					Official website of "Wednesday".<br />
					- <a href="https://www.netflix.com/title/81231974" target="_blank">Wednesday (Netflix)</a>
				</p>
